            "detailed_description": "Formally named Pro Skater 2D but Activision made a DCMA request<br />\r\nA skateboarding game for tony hawk series fans!<br />\r\nOver 70 various goals to beat in over 8 big levels! This game has all it needs for a complete skateboarding experience:<br />\r\n- Over 30 tricks to beat<br />\r\n- get special and make some special tricks<br />\r\n- manuals and grinds with balance meter<br />\r\n- secret gaps to find<br />\r\n- combine tricks in big combos<br />\r\n- do spine transfers<br />\r\nPRO TIP: By default you have to press A+D same time to do a spine transfer. If you want to use only one button to do a spine transfer(get out of a half pipe) change the controls to use A+A for example.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nHours of fun gameplay in Tony Hawk's games style.",
