                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "2D skateboarding game where you perform tricks, grinds, and combine them into combos\n\n✅Fast and dynamic arcade gameplay\n✅Over 30 different tricks\n✅Ability to combine manuals, grinds, flips, and special tricks\n✅Hidden collectibles encourage exploration\n✅Various skateparks and city locations\n✅Good graphics\n✅Energetic music that fits the arcade style\n✅Good price\n\n❌The controls in this game are very poor. They are stiff and unresponsive. Movements are not smooth, and the controls don't always respond as I clicked (the main reason I gave it an average rating)\n❌Issues with precise execution of more advanced tricks\n❌Low environmental detail\n❌The animations are quite basic\n\n❌❌Verdict: [strike] Terrible [/strike], [strike] Bad [/strike], [b] Mediocre [/b], [strike] Decent [/strike], [strike] Good [/strike], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for short games, retro indie simulator games, and similar)\n\n[quote]If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand he we group:\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask.\nI'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!!\nBest regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
